MASTER TEST RUN chat #8 (2 of 2 each): „introduce me to <seat>" and
„როგორ მივწვდე ბახვა გამოგონილს?" ran web_search on the name, and the
reply quoted real people from the web who share it. A person the owner
names is reached through the network; the web only knows strangers with
the same name.

An owner's run whose line asks to meet or reach somebody (გამაცანი,
დამაკავშირე, მივწვდე, introduce me, how can I reach…) and names no
trade does not hold web_search or fetch_page — the same way inviteHeld
holds invite_contact. No new words to the model. A line that names a
trade, in any Georgian case („დამაკავშირე იურისტთან"), keeps the web
for the 1454 web-people paragraph.

Also: the ⚠ in answerNotQuestion.ts's comment was written as a literal
escape in 0124; it is the sign again.

